  "notes": "Researched from public atmosenergy.com pages only. The Account Center sign-in offers Forgot your username or password?, so the identifier is a username. A one-time payment without login needs only the account number and allows up to $350 above the current balance. Residential card and digital-wallet payments carry no fee (non-residential pay a vendor fee, not modelled). The Automatic Payment Plan drafts a bank account or credit/debit card and enrolling also enrolls the customer in E-Bill (the engine cannot couple the two). Installment plans are free and set up from the Payment Assistance tab in the Account Center. Stop Service is an Account Center move-out flow (close date plus final-bill address). MFA is not documented (family default).",
